Get on a fucking plane...

692
00:54:10.473 --> 00:54:12.473
Shut the fuck up.
...and fly to the fucking beach.

693
00:54:12.483 --> 00:54:14.543
What makes you think
I didn't try?

694
00:54:17.653 --> 00:54:20.582
Man, when I walk past a place,

695
00:54:20.583 --> 00:54:22.983
I clock the traffic
three blocks around.

696
00:54:24.093 --> 00:54:26.092
How far to the street,

697
00:54:26.093 --> 00:54:28.122
