can support a strongbox,

701
00:54:35.233 --> 00:54:37.132
whether I should
load in a drill,

702
00:54:37.133 --> 00:54:39.233
or if there's a pick-point
strong enough

703
00:54:39.243 --> 00:54:42.072
so I can drop the unit
into a car downstairs.

704
00:54:42.073 --> 00:54:45.142
Been the same way since I was

705
00:54:45.143 --> 00:54:48.112
popping spoilers off of Supras,

706
00:54:48.113 --> 00:54:51.053
