that gets in the way.

720
00:56:00.852 --> 00:56:06.091
Didn't you ever think they might
not just be a fantasy?

721
00:56:06.092 --> 00:56:08.221
You know, that you might
be getting in the way

722
00:56:08.222 --> 00:56:10.191
