instead of getting on board?

725
00:56:19.531 --> 00:56:21.370
You know,
but every once in a while

726
00:56:21.371 --> 00:56:22.840
even a degenerate gambler

727
00:56:22.841 --> 00:56:26.411
can tell a guy
when it's time to cash out.

728
00:56:33.881 --> 00:56:35.621
She said...

729
00:56:38.621 --> 00:56:41.321
said she was going to get
a puppy when it came time.

730
00:56:46.231 --> 00:56:49.200
Told me I could pick it out
if I was ready to join her.

731
00:56:49.201 --> 00:56:52.831
You said you couldn't leave,
she said she wouldn't wait.

732
00:56:52.841 --> 00:56:56.501
But the way you two of you
looked at each other...

733
00:56:57.771 --> 00:57:00.211
I think you might both be liars.

734
00:57:16.321 --> 00:57:18.531
We're getting the fuck
out of here.

735
00:57:19.661 --> 00:57:21.430
Both of us.

736
00:57:21.431 --> 00:57:23.431
If you say so.
It's your show.

737
00:57:33.240 --> 00:57:34.480
Up.

738
00:57:35.680 --> 00:57:37.210
Sit.

739
01:01:21.037 --> 01:01:22.897
Oh, fuck.

740
01:01:27.507 --> 01:01:30.477
Oh, Christ.

741
01:01:58.167 --> 01:01:59.907
Jesus.

742
01:02:11.487 --> 01:02:12.816
Jesus.

743
01:02:34.606 --> 01:02:36.006
Easy.

744
