Walk?

759
01:10:41.989 --> 01:10:44.449
Guess you really are
a dog person.

760
01:10:47.259 --> 01:10:49.189
Let's get you up.
Come on.

761
01:10:59.469 --> 01:11:01.439
Here, sit down.
Sit down.

762
